# Cabeceras de seguridad y caché. Cloudflare Pages las aplica automáticamente.
#
# La CSP no permite scripts en línea. Next.js genera algunos en el HTML para
# hidratar; scripts/csp-hashes.mjs calcula su SHA-256 en cada build y sustituye
# __INLINE_SCRIPT_HASHES__ en out/_headers. Si el marcador no se sustituye, el
# build falla: nunca se publica una CSP incompleta.
#
# Terceros permitidos (anotados en SPEC.md, sección 8):
#   - Google Tag Manager y Google Analytics 4: medición.
#   - Google Ads (googleadservices, doubleclick, google.com): conversiones de la
#     campaña, que marketing configura desde GTM sin tocar código.
#
# Antes del release, verificar en https://securityheaders.com (objetivo: A o A+).

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' __INLINE_SCRIPT_HASHES__ https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://www.google.com; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://www.googletagmanager.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://www.google.com https://www.google.com.mx; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://www.google.com https://www.google.com.mx; frame-src https://www.googletagmanager.com https://td.doubleclick.net; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), magnetometer=(), gyroscope=(), accelerometer=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-DNS-Prefetch-Control: off

/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
